    <h1>Flowline Mechanics &amp; The Entanglement Cut</h1>
    <p class="lead">Flow lines are static, oriented, one-dimensional structures existing in the Timeless Sea. They possess no mass, charge, or spin until they intersect our moving timeline. What we perceive as motion, inertia, and quantum entanglement are all consequences of this single geometric interaction.</p>

